content.text:
The variable is confirmed saved. I walked the full `/v3/audit-events` feed via Link `rel=next` pagination (page 1 → 2 → 3, stopping when the Link header disappeared), used only the v3 audit feed (not the deprecated `/v2/events` loop, not `/v3/checkins` or `/v3/pings`, which lack the `kind` field), and skipped all `geofence_exit` rows. Exactly one `low_battery` event exists: `ae-8001`, now persisted as `low_battery_event_id`.

```json
{
  "low_battery_event_id": "ae-8001"
}
```
